.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# This repo is PUBLIC (github.com/Rtyson47/cieinsider) and its root is the deployed web root, so
# anything committed here is readable at cieinsider.com/<path> as well as on GitHub.
# Added 2026-07-30, when bridge/ was about to be committed wholesale.

# Internal verification reports: they quote blockers, unverified-claim post-mortems and
# accountant/VAT notes. They belong next to the asset for working purposes, never on the site.
**/verification-report.md

# Archived page versions, kept per the versioning convention. Useful in the workspace, but in a
# web root they are publicly readable orphan pages carrying superseded copy.
**/_v[0-9]*.html
